    "language": "en",
    "text": " So at the University of Oulu, and we can use it in a safe way so that we don't have to upload the data that we have into public servers or servers that we don't know where they exist. So Whisper, the way in which we can use Whisper is sort of internally inside the University of Oulu. So it's a safe process. All the data stays here. And that's why we use that. And that's why we haven't used any other speech recognition tools, because the data we have is often sensitive. And in the agreements that we've made with the people that we've recorded is that we don't upload the data that we have to public servers or the internet and so on. So that's why we only use Whisper. So that's why we've used it so far only. Yeah."
